-- TRACE object_written: .github/workflows/artifact-a1-pr-producer.yml:produce-artifact:2 - 共有objectの保存が成功する．
-- TRACE object_restored: .github/workflows/artifact-a2-safe-consumer.yml:consume-after-verification:0 - 同じ共有objectを後続workflowが取得する．
-- TRACE object_used: .github/workflows/artifact-a2-safe-consumer.yml:consume-after-verification:2 - 取得した内容を後続処理が利用する．
-- TRACE integrity_checked: .github/workflows/artifact-a2-safe-consumer.yml:consume-after-verification:1 - 復元した内容を利用する前に完全性を確認する．
-- TRACE authority_reached: .github/workflows/artifact-a2-safe-consumer.yml:consume-after-verification:2 - 検証済み成果物だけを模擬公開判断へ渡す．
MODULE main
VAR
  stage : {start, object_written, object_restored, integrity_checked, object_used, authority_reached, blocked};
  object_tainted : boolean;
